* =====================================================================================================
* usb_input__nrf52840_usb.lib  -  nRF52840 USB pins (VBUS, D+, D-) as seen from the link, main U10
* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Part      : Nordic nRF52840 (inside Raytac MDBT50Q-U1MV2; the module brings VBUS/D+/D- straight out)
* Datasheet : nRF52840 Product Specification v1.1 (4413_417, 2019-02-28)
*             https://cdn.sparkfun.com/assets/d/2/6/2/6/nRF52840_PS_v1.1.pdf (mirror of the Nordic PDF)
* Vendor model: none found (no SPICE model of the nRF52840 USB pins is published).
*
* Modelled:
*   VBUS load    IUSB,ACTIVE,VBUS 2.4 mA typ (PS 6.35.14.1)                        -> param ivbus
*                drawn above VBUS,DETECT (4.0 V typ, PS 5.3.8.7)
*   D+/D- pads   CPAD 3 pF (PS 6.9.3.1 GPIO electrical specification; USB pads assumed alike)
*   VUSB33 rail  the D+/D- PHY supply, 3.3 V typ (PS 5.3.8.6 VUSB33 3.0..3.6 V) -> param vusb
*                (0 V when VBUS is absent), decoupled by CDECUSB 4.7 uF typ (PS 5.3.8.6)
*   pad ESD clamps: ASSUMED generic diodes to VUSB33 and from GND (IS 1e-15, N 1, RS = resd), and
*                from GND on VBUS. Nordic does not specify the internal ESD structure. resd default
*                3 ohm = typical TLP slope of an HBM-2 kV-class on-chip clamp path (diode + rail
*                clamp); the tests also run 1 ohm (more current, conservative) and 10 ohm (less).
* Ratings used by the tests (not enforced in the model, PS Table 173 Absolute maximum ratings):
*   VBUS -0.3 .. +5.8 V; I/O pin voltage -0.3 .. VDD + 0.3 V; ESD HBM 2 kV (aQFN73, class 2);
*   USB operating VBUS 4.35 .. 5.5 V (PS 5.3.8.5).
* NOT modelled: the USB regulator's dynamics, a positive-going VBUS-pin clamp (none is specified; the
*   tests compare the VBUS node with the 5.8 V abs max instead),
*   the PHY drivers / pull-ups (the tests look at transients with the PHY idle), temperature effects.
* Pins: VBUS, DP, DM, GND
* =====================================================================================================
.subckt USBIN_NRF52840_USB VBUS DP DM GND params: ivbus=2.4m vusb=3.3 cpad=3p resd=3
Bvbus VBUS GND I=ivbus*0.5*(1+tanh((v(VBUS,GND)-4.0)/0.05))
Rvbus VBUS GND 10Meg
* VUSB33 rail (internal regulator output + CDECUSB)
Vusb  vreg GND {vusb}
Rusb  vreg vusb33 0.1
Cdec  vusb33 GND 4.7u
* pad capacitance and assumed ESD clamp diodes
Cdp   DP GND {cpad}
Cdm   DM GND {cpad}
Dpu   DP vusb33 USBIN_NRF_ESD
Dpd   GND DP    USBIN_NRF_ESD
Dmu   DM vusb33 USBIN_NRF_ESD
Dmd   GND DM    USBIN_NRF_ESD
Dvbd  GND VBUS  USBIN_NRF_ESD
.model USBIN_NRF_ESD D(IS=1e-15 N=1 RS={resd} CJO=0)
.ends USBIN_NRF52840_USB
